# --- Database ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Supabase connection string. Use the TRANSACTION POOLER (port 6543), NOT the
# "Direct connection" string, for two independent reasons:
#
#   1. Serverless functions open a connection per instance and exhaust the
#      direct-connection limit under load. The client sets `prepare: false` to
#      match the pooler's transaction mode.
#   2. The direct host (db.<ref>.supabase.co) resolves to an AAAA record only.
#      On an IPv4-only network -- which includes most laptops and Vercel's free
#      tier -- it fails with ENOTFOUND, which reads like a wrong hostname rather
#      than a missing IPv6 route.
#
# Supabase dashboard -> Connect -> "Transaction pooler". Note the username gains
# the project ref (postgres.<ref>, not postgres). URL-encode special characters
# in the password: an unescaped @ or # silently breaks the URL parse.
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://postgres.<project-ref>:<password>@aws-0-<region>.pooler.supabase.com:6543/postgres"

# --- Authentication ---------------------------------------------------------
# Comma-separated list of accepted API keys. Multiple values are supported so a
# key can be rotated without downtime: add the new key, migrate senders, then
# remove the old one. Generate with: openssl rand -hex 32
API_KEYS="px_test_replace_me"

# --- Ingestion policy -------------------------------------------------------
# Telemetry older than this many days is rejected as stale (default 90).
TELEMETRY_MAX_AGE_DAYS=90
# Telemetry further ahead than this many minutes is rejected as clock skew
# or a device fault (default 60).
TELEMETRY_MAX_FUTURE_SKEW_MINUTES=60

# --- Observability ----------------------------------------------------------
LOG_LEVEL=info

# --- Tests ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional. When set, tests/db.integration.test.ts runs against this database.
# Point it at a THROWAWAY database: the suite truncates tables.
# TEST_DATABASE_URL="postgresql://postgres:postgres@localhost:5432/pxtest"
